OL,3,GNEWSARebuilding of demolished mosque
OL,4,Aapproved
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to rebuild an established mosque
OL,7,Fin Rotherham have been approved.
OL,9,FThe previously single-storey building
OL,10,Fon Broom Lane was recently demolished
OL,11,Fhaving operated as a mosque for more
OL,12,Fthan a decade.
OL,14,FObjectors had claimed the proposed new
OL,15,Ftwo-storey development would cause
OL,16,F"overshadowing", congestion and parking
OL,17,Fissues on the street.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
