OL,3,GNEWSARebuilding of demolished mosque
OL,4,Aapproved
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut councillors approved the scheme
OL,7,Fafter being told it closely resembled a
OL,8,Fprevious proposal that was granted
OL,9,Fplanning permission in 2018 but was
OL,10,Fultimately never built.
